{"slug":"ashanti-receives-her-flowers-from-brandy-for-soul-train-awards-performance","postId":74364,"title":"Ashanti Receives Her Flowers From Brandy For Soul Train Awards Performance","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":514323,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/GetPaidStock.com-61d7c1840130b.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-514323\"/><figcaption>Ashanti and Brandy during Olympus Fashion Week Spring 2006 - Kai Milla - Front Row and Backstage at The New York Public Library at 42nd Street in New York City, New York, United States. (Photo by Jemal Countess/WireImage)</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last November, Ashanti performed at the Soul Train Awards on BET, proving why she deserved the 2021 The Lady Of Soul Award.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/mqDuiqThMZI\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/mqDuiqThMZI\n</div><figcaption><br>The What's Love Got to Do With It singer was recently on Instagram Live wishing her fans a Happy New Year and having a good time with friends when Brandy hopped in her comments giving her flowers for her performance at the Soul Train Awards. <br><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"That performance on BET was Everything,\" said Brandy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before the Soul Train Awards premiered on BET, she went o<a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2021/11/23/ashanti-says-she-has-a-movie-dropping-at-the-top-of-2022-will-be-re-recording-music-soon-watch/\">n Instagram Live last month</a> and revealed that she also received the Lady Of Soul Award and also a Presidential Proclamation from The City Council of Baltimore plaque. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>She also would go on to reveal that she had a movie on the way and that she will be getting back into the studio to re-recording her records to own her masters. Since Irv Gotti currently owns her original masters. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Ashanti and Brandy during Olympus Fashion Week Spring 2006 - Kai Milla - Front Row and Backstage at The New York Public Library at 42nd Street in New York City, New York, United States. (Photo by…","publishedAt":"2022-01-07T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-01-07T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"chad-hughes","displayName":"Chad Hughes"},"categories":[{"slug":"music","name":"Music"},{"slug":"news","name":"News"}],"tags":[{"slug":"ashanti","name":"Ashanti"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"kente-scott","name":"Kenté Scott"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"soul-train-awards","name":"Soul Train Awards"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/GetPaidStock.com-61d7c1840130b.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/GetPaidStock.com-61d7c1840130b.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/ashanti-receives-her-flowers-from-brandy-for-soul-train-awards-performance/"}